SY_TALK("zw8zFoNgm2Q",[[17,["1983-11-05 Talk To Sahaja Yogis, Eve Of Diwali Puja"]],[25,["I've had a very hectic, strenuous journey through America"]],[32,["and it was much beyond my expectation, it worked","out very well and I'm very happy about it."]],[42,["All the Americans are very thankful to the Sahaja Yogis of England"]],[50,["and other countries who have contributed to this tour"]],[55,["and specially to people who travelled across and went around"]],[60,["and helped them to organize."]],[65,["So they have been extremely grateful I tell you,"]],[70,["but for you people it would not have been possible."]],[74,["It was a very strenuous journey, no doubt, and strenuous tour"]],[80,["and everything was a bit too much after the tour of Europe."]],[88,["But the way people went from here and","you helped them, and you sent money."]],[95,["There was much less strain on them and they could manage it very well"]],[98,["and as you know that we","have done very well as far as"]],[104,["our sowing the seed of Sahaja Yoga is concerned."]],[111,["So the seed of Sahaja Yoga, I think, is now sown"]],[114,["and it may take a big flight,"]],[120,["I am sure because Americans have I know"]],[122,["they are very, people who are uprooted type"]],[126,["and quite shallow people, and one can say that also"]],[132,["that they go on changing their gurus every third day"]],[137,["and their cars every fourth day and their wives fifth day."]],[144,["But they have changed so many of them that it is easier to bring them round"]],[149,["and talk to them about reality,","that is the greatest part of it"]],[156,["and the most of them have been to some guru or someone."]],[162,["I think better give Me doesn't sound..."]],[165,["And the result of all that is that they have reached conclusions"]],[172,["that if reality has to come it should","come in the way Sahaja Yoga is."]],[180,["So it's not such a difficult thing to talk to them about Sahaja Yoga."]],[184,["But the best part of it, they have been to all gurus"]],[187,["who have given them a good licking, real good licking."]],[191,["They have lost all their money, they have been trained so much,"]],[194,["they had to do all kinds of things and"]],[197,["they had to starve themselves and no food"]],[200,["and sometimes they had to run for miles together,"]],[206,["do all kinds of acrobatics and","all kinds of things they have done."]],[211,["As a result, to them, Sahaja Yoga is very precious."]],[216,["This is a difference I think with others and Americans is,"]],[220,["because you have not known those severe type of gurus"]],[224,["that they have had who just torture their lives all the time"]],[227,["saying that, \"you have to do these things,"]],[230,["just to get rid of your sins and this has to be done,"]],[233,["because of your sins, you are like this\"."]],[236,["And the main thing was, I discovered there"]],[240,["that the philosophers or the writers who wrote about the unconscious"]],[245,["have also made a very big mistake. And they said that"]],[248,["if you have to go to the unconscious,","you have to pass through subconscious."]],[253,["And when I saw this diagram I was surprised."]],[257,["Jung had done the diagram with the unconscious"]],[261,["and the unconscious becoming conscious and on top of that,"]],[265,["was the subconscious and then the conscious mind"]],[271,["and then the ego. So it was such a mixed bag."]],[274,["So I told them that god is the greatest planner"]],[277,["and He has kept the central path for you absolutely open"]],[282,["which is Sushumna path and the subconscious is on left"]],[286,["and the supraconscious is on the right side."]],[288,["So you don't have to pass through all these things."]],[291,["Even in an airport supposing you have to pass through the luggage"]],[295,["to go to the aeroplane what will happen?"]],[298,["And when human beings can understand that? What about God?"]],[302,["He has to be a greater organiser, a greater thinker than we are."]],[309,["And he could not have thought of such a mixed bag for us that"]],[312,["when we have to ascend we have to go through our subconcious"]],[316,["and then go to the unconscious. So the whole thing is"]],[319,["they had no picture, it was all a mental projection."]],[323,["And that's  how they made all the mistakes there"]],[326,["and when they published these things, perhaps the gurus"]],[329,["who are agurus must have taken a clue"]],[333,["and that's how they started talking that you have to go to unconscious."]],[337,["and that's how the whole thing has been worked out that people thought"]],[341,["that we have to go to the","unconscious through the subconscious."]],[346,["And when this happened they said that if you have to go to"]],[350,["the subconscious we must bear up everything,"]],[352,["we must get possessed, we must get bhootish, we must take drugs,"]],[357,["we must do all those things that the mad people are doing."]],[361,["In addition to that they used Bible for that purpose,"]],[364,["because in the Bible it is said that when the Holy Ghost came"]],[367,["they all started behaving like mad people."]],[369,["This was Mr Paul's mischief and that's how they justified it"]],[374,["that we all have to get mad to become spiritual."]],[379,["So this kind of a stupid idea was taken over and was exploited"]],[384,["by the real thugs of India. Then it is now taken over"]],[391,["by the thugs of Amercians also. So the Americans are also"]],[396,["forming some groups there, they have also become gurus"]],[399,["and they are also teaching people that you have to become"]],[405,["mad before becoming realized soul."]],[409,["It's such a thing that they never understood that"]],[412,["there has to be some sort of a way made by God Himself for our ascent."]],[417,["Why will He make it so difficult?"]],[419,["He has never made even a sprouting of the seed difficult,"]],[423,["why will He make our evolution so difficult?"]],[426,["And that's why these poor things, you see, half of them are mad."]],[429,["Really mad people, when they came to Sahaja Yoga, they had blisters"]],[432,["all over their hands. All blisters on the left hand side, you could see"]],[436,["all their hands were burning. Shaking all the time before Me,"]],[439,["it was terrible I mean, I had to go on combating their bhoots"]],[445,["and I really go tired with it, absolutely tired."]],[448,["Every place I went, there were people who had lots of these possessions in them."]],[453,["But the beauty about them which one should learn from them"]],[456,["is that once they realized that this is the way, it is the truth,"]],[460,["they are working very hard, extremely hard"]],[463,["and they are very disciplined people, they get up in the morning,"]],[468,["have their baths, sit down for meditation, they work it out."]],[471,["They are not like us, you see, we are very happy, you see,"]],[475,["floating in the air, \"Mother is looking after us, it's all right,"]],[479,["we can get up at nine o'clock and then it's alright,"]],[483,["we say namaskar to Mother, write a nice poetry about her\", finished."]],[488,["They are not like that. They are working it out"]],[491,["because what they said was very remarkable thing, what they said that,"]],[495,["\"Mother, we have gone to hell actually."]],[498,["And we have to really jet out, very fast, if you have to get out of it"]],[502,["otherwise we will never be there\", which is a fact."]],[505,["And this is what one has to understand that"]],[508,["if you have to have any rapport with your spirit,"]],[517,["you have to really work very hard. Now our -"]],[521,["so far our Sahaja Yoga in the west, so far, I would say,"]],[524,["not further because today is new year's day,"]],[527,["we have to take certain vows on a new year's day, isn't it?"]],[529,["So, so far has been a easy chair, as you call it, politician."]],[534,["And another thing that I discovered very funny there,"]],[537,["which now I understand why people are like this in this country,"]],[541,["also everywhere which, you see, you understand it better"]],[543,["when you are little away from that place."]],[546,["So another thing I discovered was that"]],[548,["this cult called Christian ethics, you can say,"]],[551,["I hope you have not talked about, have you? All right."]],[554,["Now the Christian ethics they told me was really"]],[557,["explained many things why you behave like this."]],[560,["Like one lady told me a story that there was a fellow who had"]],[564,["a store of his own and he used very good locks, you see, to secure it."]],[571,["So the people protested saying that why did you lock your things so well,"]],[575,["you should have given a chance for a burglar,"]],[579,["you see, after all you could insure yourself but","why did you take away the chance of a burglar?"]],[584,["That kind of a Christian ethics works in our minds, you see."]],[588,["So what we do, we always sympathize with a bhoot all the time."]],[592,["You see.\"Oh She is,Mother, so badly off, she is like this\"."]],[596,["\"Arey baba! She is a bhoot\". Didn't Modi tell you the saying of Ramadasa?"]],[602,["Sanggetla tumhi?(did you tell them?)"]],[610,["So Modi said this, there which is Ramdas Swamy has said it,"]],[615,["pishacha means a bhoot of a style, you see which sticks onto people,"]],[620,["is pishacha. So he said,\"Pishacha mage pishacha gele\","]],[624,["after one bhoot, another bhoot has gone."]],[628,["So who can go after that?"]],[631,["Who can save that? I mean if they are going after the bhoot,"]],[635,["and what sarthak means- what will they achieve out of it?"]],[639,["The whole thing is that our mind \"oh he is very much, Mother,"]],[643,["we must help that person, we must do this for that person.\""]],[647,["All this Christian ethics is nonsensical."]],[649,["But Christ never said, he took a big hunter and beat all the people"]],[653,["who had bhoots and took them out and put them in the sea."]],[658,["So this is some sort of Christian is different from Christ,"]],[661,["so the Christian ethics is that always sympathize","with a person who is a bhootish person."]],[669,["Always, A bhootish person also has a method of creating sympathies."]],[674,["So today on New Year's day, I think I should warn you certain things"]],[680,["that I have realized after going to","America."]],[683,["My human realization is improving."]],[697,["I had seen once, you see, there was lady who was running a restaurant."]],[704,["And one thief, you see, had stolen a coat from one restaurant and came to her restaurant"]],[710,["and would not pay the money and she","informed the police. So the police said"]],[714,["\"Has he got a very good coat?\" \"Yes\", she said, \"he has\"."]],[716,["\"He's stolen from the other restaurant, we've","got the reports\". So the police came in."]],[722,["So they filed a suit against this man that \"he is a thief,"]],[725,["he has stolen a coat from there and ate food here, never paid anything\"."]],[730,["So these people, both the restaurant people had to go to the court"]],[734,["and give evidence saying that, you see, this fellow has stolen the coat"]],[739,["and he didn't pay for anything and he was quarelling."]],[743,["And they have to spend two days and waste their money"]],[746,["because they earning out of their own restaurants."]],[749,["So the judge said, \"Doesn't matter, he was drunk at that time,"]],[754,["so he should be forgiven because he was drunk\", firstly."]],[758,["And secondly he was given money because he said,"]],[761,["\"I have no money now with me to travel around\","]],[764,["while these people lost their money for two days."]],[767,["And the police sat down with the hand like this.","So this kind of ethics that we have, you see,"]],[772,["is to sympathize always with bhoots, you see, wrong doers."]],[776,["Even if you read the newspaper, you are shocked."]],[779,["How are they released on one point that they were in imbalance?"]],[784,["Because they were in imbalance, so they were released."]],[788,["They are sent on a parole, that man goes and kills"]],[791,["ten people again, but because he was imbalanced."]],[794,["So it is more necessary that you keep him, if he is imbalance,."]],[797,["it is more necessary. To be imbalanced","is itself a sin, itself is criminal."]],[806,["If somebody is imbalanced, that means he is a criminal personality"]],[809,["and such a criminal personality must be kept in lock and key."]],[813,["Like in France I saw, I was going by a bus,"]],[816,["now I understand many things, I didn't understand them before, I must say."]],[820,["So in France we were going by bus and one person boxing"]],[825,["he was talking all kind of things. I said,\"Oh God,"]],[828,["This one is only spilling bhoots from his mouth, who is he?\""]],[831,["They said he is a man who is talking about the war."]],[835,["I was so shocked, I said this man is talking about the war"]],[838,["and these things, why is he allowed to come on a bus?"]],[841,["Then the second one came in, then a lady came in,"]],[844,["they were all talking, talking away something irrelevantly."]],[847,["They said these are all people who have suffered very much"]],[851,["and they are coming into the bus and that's why they are like this."]],[859,["So I said,\"But why allow this people to come in?"]],[861,["In India nobody will allow such a person to come inside.\""]],[864,["So I think Marie was there, she said \"You see our government is"]],[867,["very sympathetic,you see, towards such people.\""]],[870,["I said, \"But what about the rest of them? They are not sympathetic about the other people,"]],[874,["atleast they should be sometimes for a","change sympathetic with sane people.\""]],[878,["To have always sympathies with the insanity also shows that"]],[882,["you are encouraging all the bhootish people to develop,"]],[885,["to do what they like. I mean this is no sympathy at all."]],[890,["That is how this works out and I have seen"]],[893,["this bhootish sympathy has also given Me lot of trouble."]],[897,["So you have to be little sympathetic towards your poor Mother."]],[902,["Now all sympathies of your bhoots must be given up."]],[905,["Because that has given Me lot of trouble throughout"]],[907,["and now I understand why you people","always sympathize with bhoot people."]],[913,["Now, as it is, in England, it is a sin to awaken somebody in the morning."]],[918,["I mean we have had big quarrels, fights, bouts, breaking of noses,"]],[924,["everything because somebody woke up somebody in the morning time."]],[929,["And people sympathize and came and told, “Mother, after all you see"]],[934,["this gentleman went and woke them up or the child started crying"]],[938,["in the morning and that person got up in the morning”."]],[940,["So it is a sinful thing in the West that if you wake up someone."]],[945,["But, you see, you have to change yourself now, if you have to be yogis,"]],[948,["you must know that you cannot get easy chair yogi position."]],[955,["Normally you have to go to Himalayas, live in that cold,"]],[960,["eat nothing for days together, wash off all your desires,"]],[965,["give up your wife, your children, everyone."]],[968,["But Sahaja Yoga, so far has been, you can have your wife,"]],[971,["even if she is slightly bhootish, is all right."]],[975,["But if she is very much bhootish, still I have to worry about"]],[978,["the bhootish woman. Even if she destroys Sahaja Yoga, doesn’t matter,"]],[982,["the sympathies are there. Even if she","does anything, that’s a wife, after all."]],[987,["Or a husband who is a bhootish, I get every time a letter,"]],[990,["\"my husband is a bhootish man, he beats me, he does this.\""]],[995,["Now, what am I to tell? You divorce your husband, what should I say?"]],[1001,["I mean, if he is bhootish, how can you be with a bhoot?"]],[1004,["You are a realized soul and gradually what happens"]],[1007,["that you develop such a immunity with the bhoot"]],[1009,["that you don’t know you have become yourself a big bhoot"]],[1013,["And you go on with that and this. Can you imagine?"]],[1017,["We are creating here a race of yogis, of pure people."]],[1022,["Now, why people were going to Himalayas?","Because there were no bhoots there."]],[1026,["You see, very few people went there, stayed away from the madding crowd."]],[1031,["You are staying in this horrible, hellish atmosphere,"]],[1035,["where there are bhoots and bhoots and bhoots, all kinds."]],[1039,["Now here it is more necessary that you should be very careful,"]],[1043,["supposing, you see, plague breaks out, any country."]],[1049,["Then how people become cautious, they are so frightened that"]],[1053,["\"we should not catch anything from the plague\", isn’t it?"]],[1056,["In the same way we must know, now you are conscious of it."]],[1060,["But on the contrary this bhootish attachments are so great"]],[1064,["that I do not know how to fight it."]],[1067,["And the best part of it, you see, if you tell anybody, \"why did you do it?\""]],[1070,["They say \"it is the bhoot who did\". But from","where is he residing? In your own house."]],[1076,["Supposing in this house somebody is residing and he explodes the whole house,"]],[1079,["will you say that \"the man who was residing has done it\"?"]],[1083,["You have to blame yourself. Why do you allow a bhoot to be abide in you?"]],[1087,["So today is a day,"]],[1090,["I mean yesterday’s day was a special day of Lakshmi puja."]],[1094,["And you will be surprised in our house we put all the lights on."]],[1099,["And the candles were lit up. As soon as the candles were lit up"]],[1102,["all My this, My foot, went into a contortion absolutely."]],[1106,["It could not be brought to normal state. For at least half an hour,"]],[1109,["we were struggling with it. The reason is all the bhoots of London"]],[1112,["perhaps touched My feet. And they got into there, that “save us”. So this is the situation is."]],[1118,["While you are not at all aware of it."]],[1122,["Now people think that you can compromise with righteousness,"]],[1130,["with God. You cannot. You cannot compromise."]],[1136,["Whatever is pure has to be accepted in its purity, in its glory,"]],[1142,["and one has to work hard for it. You cannot just, you'll have your jobs,"]],[1145,["you’ll have your wives, you’ll eat your food, the special type of things,"]],[1149,["you must have your comforts, you must have everything."]],[1151,["Is a first class journey to God."]],[1160,["And the bhoots along with it going","towards God. Everybody is in the baggage."]],[1169,["This is what one has to understand, we are yogis"]],[1172,["and we are people blessed specially to elevate the whole world."]],[1178,["We are responsible for the whole Western","world."]],[1181,["And what are we doing about it?"]],[1184,["And I asked these people who have been to gurus, I was amazed."]],[1187,["Of course, money part was there, one thousand rupees each."]],[1191,["And they said that \"we are given food which nobody can eat\". You get sick."]],[1196,["One lady told me that she ate such a food that she developed a horrible disease"]],[1201,["and \"doctors told me that I first of all give up this food.\""]],[1205,["And you are forced to eat that food. And you have to wear very,"]],[1210,["I mean, flimsy clothes and stand on the streets, sing songs,"]],[1217,["walk in a procession, dance like a mad person,"]],[1221,["do all kind of things they do."]],[1226,["Here in Sahaja Yoga they said nothing, is a drawing room treatment."]],[1231,["But in the drawing room if you carry your bhoots also with you"]],[1234,["that’s not allowed."]],[1237,["That’s not allowed. So one has to understand"]],[1240,["that though we have got our realization"]],[1244,["we have a very big responsibility and we","have to move with that responsibility."]],[1251,["The greatest problem now of UK, also of France, I have seen,"]],[1255,["because of drinking habits or whatever it is, is lethargy."]],[1260,["Excuses, brain is very…"]],[1262,["I tell you our Sahaja yogis also have tremendous brains."]],[1265,["I mean sometimes I don’t know how to work on their excuses."]],[1268,["“We had a public meeting which finished at eleven o’clock,"]],[1272,["so we couldn’t get up till eleven o’clock next day”."]],[1274,["Twelve hours sleep you must have. Very hard working people."]],[1278,["But your Mother sleeps the same time and I am a marathon race runner,"]],[1284,["every night whenever. I mean you have only one program,"]],[1288,["but then I go to Italy, I go to any place,"]],[1292,["I have regularly, the whole year I am doing this."]],[1295,["Still I get up early in the morning then why can’t you get up?"]],[1300,["All excuses are there: this is an excuse another is an excuse"]],[1303,["and then I have told so many people that \"just get up at about four o’clock in the morning.\""]],[1308,["Just get up, try and see and do it, it’s very good."]],[1310,["four o’clock I’ve been saying for the last ten years now."]],[1313,["I don’t how many of you have tried that."]],[1317,["Have your bath, get ready, have your bath"]],[1323,["and then sit down for meditation."]],[1325,["The whole day will pass out very well and sleep at about 8 o’clock."]],[1330,["It is English saying that ‘early to bed and early to rise’."]],[1333,["But I have never seen any Englishman like that so far. It is the other way round."]],[1338,["They’ll keep awake till one o’clock and get","up at about eleven o’clock or ten o’clock;"]],[1345,["will not even brush their teeth and walk out. These habits you have to change,"]],[1349,["we are yogis","and we have to worship the Sun."]],[1352,["So we have to get up much before the Sun rise."]],[1356,["That is very important."]],[1359,["But I find that is not here. People don’t understand."]],[1363,["They want to take Sahaja Yoga in a very slow way"]],[1366,["and you will move very slowly and so many of you will drop out I tell you."]],[1371,["One must understand.Today is a new year’s","day and we must understand what are we doing."]],[1377,["This is a real warning to all of you."]],[1382,["You just try, this is not a very big thing. You will be amazed now."]],[1386,["CP is having a conference for twenty days,"]],[1388,["every day he gets up at four thirty, every day, sleeps at twelve o’clock,"]],[1392,["every day the whole day he is working. Twenty days after all he says"]],[1396,["“once in a while I have to work hard”."]],[1401,["Our servant gets up at five thirty every day, who works very hard."]],[1406,["Why can’t you get up? You people think that you are"]],[1410,["the most unhealthy people or what is the reason?"]],[1414,["Every time you say ‘haaah’. What’s wrong with you?"]],[1419,["Nothing is wrong, you are lazy lumps that’s all, you should understand."]],[1423,["Just tell yourself \"we are lazies, extremely lazy"]],[1427,["and we have been brought up like this\". And this","comes from your ego, for your information."]],[1432,["Ego thinks, thinks, thinks, justifies everything, makes you weak"]],[1437,["and then you sleep like logs of","woods. What is going to happen?"]],[1442,["This is tamasa, complete tamasa, ego is taking you to tamasa."]],[1447,["Or, when you are not inactive, then what we do"]],[1451,["is to ride a big horse, John Gilpins, we met so many."]],[1457,["I went to Toronto, there is one John Gilpin. Mr. Patrick."]],[1462,["Was a real John Gilpin, without any single pie,"]],[1465,["he became a big administrator of money, this, that."]],[1470,["Then I find here, Mr. Jason is touched by him."]],[1473,["This is another John Gilpin, I call them what you call,"]],[1478,["James Bonds."]],[1482,["They are riding such horses."]],[1485,["So there is one group which is extremely"]],[1488,["fundamentalist about lethargy. You see, they know all the excuses,"]],[1494,["how to say to Mother “oh! this is so, we have this problem\", this, that."]],[1499,["The another group is this, riding the high horse."]],[1504,["“Mother, I have to still clear out, this is the problem”."]],[1507,["What are you doing about it? Let us face ourselves!"]],[1511,["Are we going to lag behind?"]],[1517,["You know, on a ship you have to get on to the gangway at least."]],[1520,["If you move so slowly, gangway will be lifted"]],[1523,["and the ship will move out, I’m telling you."]],[1526,["So one has to understand and we have to work something for Sahaja."]],[1529,["Sahaja Yoga should be first priority. Job is first priority,"]],[1532,["making money is first priority, or wife or children,"]],[1537,["all these are much more important. Then go ahead with it."]],[1542,["Marriages, another is marriage.”Mother when am I going to”"]],[1545,["People will eat my head for that also."]],[1548,["“When am I going to get married, what should I do, whom should I marry, do that”"]],[1551,["These things are not going to take you","higher. Where should be your attention?"]],[1559,["Those who are married are troublesome, those who are not married are troublesome."]],[1566,["Those who are married have problems, and those who are not married."]],[1569,["So the marriage doesn’t solve the problem of Sahaja Yoga."]],[1572,["Now they’ll say “but we…” Excuse is there. “We must create children”."]],[1576,["All right. Which children? Children which will be realized souls."]],[1579,["Do you think realized souls will be born to lazy lumps?"]],[1584,["They’ll keep them morning till evening if they are born, I tell you."]],[1591,["So one has to understand that either you are lazy"]],[1594,["and when you are active, you are James Bonds. Nothing in between."]],[1600,["And that’s how people have been avoiding taking responsibility."]],[1603,["Excuses. The whole brain system is such"]],[1606,["how to give excuse, which is anti our progress."]],[1611,["It’s destructive, this will destroy you."]],[1615,["This is destructive."]],[1618,["And this tamasa has to be conquered by willpower."]],[1622,["But if I’ll say willpower then suddenly I find"]],[1624,["ten James Bonds standing before me – “Now what?”"]],[1629,["Your poor Mother is blasted. Oh God! Now what am I to do?"]],[1633,["So I don’t know which way to go."]],[1636,["Now if you tell somebody that you have got some catches,"]],[1640,["you go and look after yourself, go away from here,"]],[1644,["then that person starts thinking that “I","am the person who is to be like an outcast”,"]],[1650,["and indulges into all kinds of miserable existences."]],[1655,["It is said that you go and get yourself alright, and cleaned","up. Instead of that, person is the most miserable person"]],[1662,["and the slightest pretext, you see, you find the person thinks he is in hell."]],[1667,["Now what to do with such people? You just tell me what is the solution for these people."]],[1674,["Now I am already sixty years of age, how","long do you want me to live? I don’t know."]],[1678,["But whatever it is you have to now get up."]],[1685,["Neither to be aggressive nor to be sleeping."]],[1690,["And this sleeping business has to go","away. Now in the ashram people stay here."]],[1694,["Anywhere, there is no discipline in our ashram."]],[1698,["You go and ask them what sort of ashram’s they have."]],[1700,["3.30 one has to get up and then what do they do?"]],[1703,["You have to clean all the compound, 3.30 in the morning in New York,"]],[1708,["which is the coldest place. You see a lady told me, she is a very rich lady."]],[1711,["She told me “3.30 I had to get up","and clean the whole compound"]],[1717,["and planting all the things and that was sold by the guru"]],[1722,["and all the money was taken by the guru himself.”"]],[1725,["So the whole business was how to make the guru prosperous."]],[1730,["And they had to get up early in the morning and go on working it out,"]],[1735,["one after another."]],[1738,["There were two people who came from Rajneesh"]],[1741,["with the same dress, you see. So these people told them"]],[1745,["that you can’t come to Mother’s program with this dress."]],[1748,["So they said we have only these two pairs of this dress"]],[1751,["and one mala left with us. The rest is all gone to guru for his Rolls Royces."]],[1757,["So we have nothing left, only this much we have left. So I said"]],[1761,["“All right baba, we will give you money now, but change this dress”."]],[1764,["This is the situation. That is how the gurus extract them."]],[1771,["But we do not try. How far have we gone? You must think."]],[1774,["Now, somebody who is a left sided person should think"]],[1778,["how far we have gone now, as our left sidedness is concerned."]],[1782,["Those who are right sided should think how far we have gone,"]],[1785,["how far in the center we have come and then think of the ascent."]],[1791,["Sahaja Yoga is simple, made easy, all right."]],[1794,["Supposing I have cooked for you, all right,"]],[1797,["you have to eat it, digest it and use that for something."]],[1802,["This cooking is done for the good of others. But people think of"]],[1806,["their family, house, children this, that, all these comforts."]],[1816,["So one has to really, dedicatedly, absolutely understand that"]],[1823,["our worth is much more than any one of these people put together."]],[1829,["I’ll say my husband is working like this, I am seeing it and I am surprised."]],[1832,["4.30 he gets up and yesterday, we had a dinner till 12 o’clock."]],[1836,["He was so alert and talking to them in such an alert way to these Chinese."]],[1841,["And every day he is doing that."]],[1845,["How does he do it? You know that when I sleep"]],[1848,["also I am working and when I am awake I am working."]],[1852,["All the time I am working. All right, you might say"]],[1855,["Mother you are Adi Shakti."]],[1857,["But this my husband is not even a realized soul, like you people are."]],[1863,["There are so many like that. And he is not aggressive by any chance."]],[1868,["So once they start working, they start thinking"]],[1871,["how to make money out of Sahaja Yoga, just imagine!"]],[1876,["Selling candles, selling this. What are these other side of it?"]],[1882,["I mean you cannot sell Sahaja Yoga."]],[1885,["That is one thing I want to tell you and proclaim today"]],[1888,["that anybody tries to do such a thing I’ll liquidate that person"]],[1892,["and make him a pukka pauper."]],[1895,["First of all you will get sick if you try to sell Sahaja Yoga."]],[1898,["Nobody has to do such things. You have to keep that side"]],[1901,["extremely clear cut, you cannot sell anything."]],[1906,["Also, whatever I am talking you cannot sell it in the market."]],[1909,["Many people have this habit of selling it out."]],[1913,["Now somebody is writing a poetry about Rama,"]],[1916,["what is the need to publish that poetry? What has it got to do with Sahaja Yoga?"]],[1921,["I am living here, you are writing","about Rama. What is the need?"]],[1927,["And who wants to hear that? Just think of it."]],[1931,["Gregoire said, “Mother we want to publish your lectures"]],[1933,["and why are they publishing somebody’s poetry there about Rama?”"]],[1939,["Is this the job we are going to do? What is our job?"]],[1945,["Is to give realizations to others,","spread Sahaja Yoga, keep ourselves pure,"]],[1951,["At a higher level become those great personalities,"]],[1955,["you see, which have achieved something. Learn music. I told you learn music,"]],[1960,["learn dancing, learn something by","which you can manifest Sahaja Yoga."]],[1968,["Otherwise, I don’t know what’s going to","happen to you and to Sahaja Yoga in the West"]],[1976,["because there is no education or discipline here."]],[1981,["We are free people, do what we like.","We have to discipline ourselves."]],[1987,["And now as you are newly born, you can do it."]],[1991,["You have to discipline, “how dare I do these things, I am a Sahaja Yogi”."]],[1997,["We have to take ourselves to task, first of all."]],[2000,["This is a very, very important thing and I find that is lacking so much."]],[2005,["And you know this disease of lethargy","or of high handedness is so contagious."]],[2012,["Mr. Patrick met Jason for five minutes he clicked him,"]],[2016,["Mr. Jason met another one, he clicked him"]],[2019,["and if I find a link, you know, it is there."]],[2022,["One lady like Jane, she meets somebody, she becomes bhootish."]],[2027,["She becomes bhootish,then another person… You can link it back."]],[2033,["You’ll be amazed, how these things work out."]],[2035,["They have a chain reaction."]],[2039,["So one has to be careful. But why not see to the person"]],[2043,["who is doing something about it, who is rising higher, who is dynamic?"]],[2054,["I know who are there."]],[2057,["They are the people I have now said these are your leaders,"]],[2062,["but some of them still go like that."]],[2066,["You must assume your powers; that’s the point I’ve been saying."]],[2069,["We have to assume our powers, we have to be wise people, grown up, matured;"]],[2075,["we cannot play like children with ourselves."]],[2079,["And this is what has been said many a times,"]],[2082,["but now whatever I’ve said it you put it in your action."]],[2087,["Fight with yourself. Don’t give excuses."]],[2090,["There are excuses and excuses which you tell me I said “All right”."]],[2093,["But, you see, I have another nature which you have not realized,"]],[2098,["I can recede!"]],[2101,["My interest is up to a point. What can I do?"]],[2104,["After some time like a glue, you know, it falls off."]],[2109,["A glue can stick you to a point."]],[2111,["If you get stuck well and good, otherwise it will fall off."]],[2116,["So that recession should not start in my mind."]],[2123,["So please be alert"]],[2128,["and don’t worry what other problems you have."]],[2132,["Also I have seen that there are forces working like this."]],[2137,["Now, somebody wants to do something,"]],[2139,["because he wants to do it you should not cut it out."]],[2142,["On principle if it is good you should say “Go ahead, we are with you”."]],[2146,["And that’s why, I see, people don’t work out. Like getting an ashram,"]],[2150,["any place will work out if everybody has positive attitude,"]],[2153,["if somebody is trying for that every collective thing."]],[2156,["But everybody will say: “But, you see, if you take the ashram"]],[2162,["then who will pay for it? We are only five people.”"]],[2165,["But Mother is there to look after you."]],[2169,["Then will be another excuse something coming up that:"]],[2173,["“You see, if you take the ashram there could be such and….”"]],[2176,["But you just take it first of all and see for yourself."]],[2180,["Like you start driving and you say: “All right, we are going this way,"]],[2185,["but there could be a jam”. But let us see if there is or not."]],[2188,["Before hand how are you saying? I mean before facing the situation,"]],[2192,["there will be ten suggestions immediately coming like a cock."]],[2200,["Jack in the box suddenly will start, you see, giving their wise advice,"]],[2206,["cutting the legs of the people who are trying to do something."]],[2210,["It’s a very common experience I have had with Myself also."]],[2214,["We are going now, see, in the car; I mean throughout America,"]],[2217,["I have been telling people, “Now will you please shut up."]],[2220,["Will you please now understand, let us do it.”"]],[2226,["They decided to have a program after this program was over."]],[2235,["It was in, I think, Vancouver. And I said, all right"]],[2240,["then call them also for puja because we have no time now"]],[2242,["to wait till they grew up and all that, call them for puja.\""]],[2246,["And I said come and have lunch also. They’ve got a fright!,"]],[2248,["“Mother we have not made any arrangements”. I said, “What is there, we will make chola”."]],[2252,["We have no cholas, how to soak it? I said “Don’t you worry.”"]],[2255,["I told them, “Let us go to some Indian restaurant here and we’ll get the chola."]],[2259,["They said “it’s not possible Mother, who will…?”."]],[2261,["I said “But let us go, I’m saying, let us go”."]],[2264,["There was a discussion about it for about half an hour."]],[2267,["“Oh! Mother is saying but how to..?” I said,"]],[2269,["“Will you please take me to some Indian restaurant, anywhere?”"]],[2273,["“Oh we have to drive about 3 miles.” I said, “Doesn’t matter”."]],[2276,["“It’s already 11.30 it will be 12 o’clock by the time we go there,"]],[2280,["there won’t be anybody”. I said, “I am telling you"]],[2283,["take me to some Indian restaurant, why don’t you take?”"]],[2286,["And the argument was on and on. I said, “Now, will you take Me?”"]],[2288,["I felt like taking a pistol."]],[2292,["And now, I said, “Hands up. Let’s…”"]],[2298,["And when I insisted too much then very reluctantly they drove Me down."]],[2302,["There was a restaurant there, I said, “Now go inside and tell this man"]],[2306,["that we want five kilos of this cholas with you if you have got chana.”"]],[2314,["So he said “I have got it.” They said, “Better get it for us”."]],[2317,["So he sold us. And he said, “I don’t know why I am selling it you,"]],[2320,["I never do that way, but I am selling it to you”. And he gave us."]],[2324,["And then he said “There’s a shop here” And he asked the person"]],[2329,["to open the shop and he gave us all the rest of it and","next day we had a nice cholas, I’ve made them for them."]],[2334,["So we had it. But before starting they really,"]],[2338,["I tell you, they ate my head off."]],[2341,["Same in Toronto, Toronto was much worse, much worse."]],[2345,["Everywhere I found this is the thing. You try to do something:"]],[2348,["\"Now you have to take this ashram\","]],[2350,["there will be ten wise people immediately sitting"]],[2354,["“But for this how can we do it?” Then you don’t have it."]],[2361,["All these explanations and all these things are not wanted."]],[2366,["If you have any positive things to do, you do it."]],[2369,["The thing is, is more talking and doing nothing is the point."]],[2373,["Action is to be taken instead of that inaction, in such a way"]],[2378,["that it’s only thought, thought, thought, thought, thought"]],[2383,["and everybody’s talking. But the system where one person talks and the rest listen"]],[2389,["always works out, like in Japan, in India,"]],[2392,["if an elder is talking, nobody talks."]],[2394,["All right! If Mother says so, all right. Go ahead”."]],[2398,["I mean Gagangan Maharaj asked these people Modi and all that"]],[2402,["“Will you jump in the sea if Mother says so? Are you willing to die for Her?”"]],[2406,["I mean this is the first question a guru asks, you see?"]],[2410,["Here? Dying? Only driving up to three miles,"]],[2413,["you have to break your neck with them. Dying is too much."]],[2419,["I cannot even talk of that. But even for everything it is happening"]],[2424,["and that’s why Sahaja Yoga doesn’t work out."]],[2426,["And those people who try to do something,"]],[2429,["either there is jealousy or pulling him down or the wise counseling."]],[2434,["“If you do it who will pay for it?” There","is Mother sitting, She will look after."]],[2440,["“You should not take the ashram on hire, this will be too much for us”."]],[2445,["Everything, if it is free is very good."]],[2449,["Now these are the two points I am saying the third point,"]],[2451,["also I have to tell you and then I’ll tell you the good news."]],[2462,["Now the third point which is very important,"]],[2465,["one has to understand about third point."]],[2469,["It’s a very small thing but expresses in a big way in everybody’s life."]],[2477,["Now, you people are much more affluent than Indians are,"]],[2483,["but the amount of headaches I have with Sahaja Yogis about money,"]],[2489,["I’ve never had in India which I must tell you very frankly."]],[2492,["First we had the ashram, you know in Dollis Hill,"]],[2496,["for which I don’t know how much money I had to shell","out. I think thousand five hundred or something."]],[2501,["Second ashram we had, we had to sell out, again there."]],[2505,["Now third ashram we had I think here also I had to do it."]],[2509,["The reason is there is no proper account."]],[2512,["Nobody knows how much money is there in the bank or not."]],[2514,["And everybody is trying to save if possible at the cost of Sahaja Yoga."]],[2520,["I mean this is such a low thing to talk about but it is so."]],[2524,["Everybody sees to one’s own personal comfort"]],[2527,["but not to the whole working of Sahaja Yoga."]],[2533,["Like so many have not even paid the rent."]],[2538,["I mean are we going to go in litigation now,"]],[2540,["when these people who have not even paid the rent?"]],[2543,["I mean just think of it, you have not even paid the rent."]],[2546,["Like in Dollis Hill they never paid the electricity, who is going to pay?"]],[2549,["Mother will pay, She does everything for us."]],[2552,["You see Mother is looking after us, isn’t it? So let Her pay for the electricity."]],[2557,["Now here it is that people have not paid the rent."]],[2563,["But for Dharma, for this great work, you have to donate."]],[2568,["No question of paying for your rent, you have to donate. Do you understand?"]],[2572,["That is one of the principles of Lakshmi."]],[2579,["These people have not understood this. You have to donate for this work."]],[2586,["You just think that Sahaja Yoga is for your advantage,"]],[2591,["all right, for spiritual advantage."]],[2593,["But you do not take advantage of Sahaja Yoga this way."]],[2596,["In India I never had this problem of money, I can tell you, this way,"]],[2600,["never, on the contrary, whenever there was a problem, they stood by Me."]],[2605,["Australia, same thing I must say, Australia has never given Me"]],[2609,["any problem of money that I have to pay out of my pocket."]],[2616,["Here the people have not paid the rent."]],[2618,["Now those who have not paid the rent let, raise your hands."]],[2623,["Honestly. So far. In the ashram."]],[2631,["Everyone has paid?"]],[2635,["- How much?","- Seven pounds"]],[2638,["That’s all, that’s not much; but it’s eight hundred pounds."]],[2646,["One must pay for Sahaja Yoga, lavishly."]],[2649,["You are staying here, pay for that."]],[2652,["You see, I have seen people, just turn their faces."]],[2655,["You are staying here. Free food is very good idea,"]],[2658,["if you can get even free lodging, London very good."]],[2663,["You have come for the program, so what?"]],[2666,["You have come here, now there’s food, is all, pay for that."]],[2669,["You must pay. You don’t understand today is the day of Diwali,"]],[2676,["where people have to pay to God, God’s work."]],[2683,["Because Lakshmi tattwa is like that."]],[2687,["You don’t have to pay the guru. Thank God, you have free guru here."]],[2691,["Only 5p this time I took, isn’t it?"]],[2696,["But you have to pay, not only for yourself but for your work."]],[2701,["You don’t even pay for yourself, you stay here free of food."]],[2705,["Think people have not paid for food. Many a times it happened."]],[2708,["They don’t even pay for the hall, one pound can you imagine?"]],[2714,["You try to save that one pound and you will be losing thousands of pounds,"]],[2718,["I tell you, don’t do like that. This is","God’s work, don’t take advantage of it."]],[2725,["And it was very far, very far I’ve seen."]],[2729,["We used to have one Indian who would come to our pujas"]],[2733,["and he would buy things for the puja. Gavin is here, he’ll tell you."]],[2736,["And it was impossible to pay him that money for that puja things that he bought."]],[2741,["He said this much my punya."]],[2744,["Even CP understands that very well. He says this is the only way"]],[2748,["I’m doing some punya. After all what punya I’m doing?"]],[2754,["While we try to save money out of Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2756,["is a very dangerous thing. Now, so far everything forgiven."]],[2762,["Why I don’t declare Myself to be Adi Shakti?"]],[2764,["because once I declare Myself as Adi Shakti,"]],[2768,["none of the sins will be forgiven, take it from Me."]],[2773,["Is a very serious thing. All of them will be alert, is already said."]],[2780,["That’s why I don’t say I am Adi Shakti, better keep at a lower level,"]],[2784,["so that at least you have given a chance."]],[2789,["There is a mess of money everywhere. How can it be with all of you"]],[2794,["so good, so intelligent, giving wise advice everywhere?"]],[2800,["And most of it is miserliness."]],[2803,["It’s so sickening, you know, to see a saint to be miserly, I’ve said hundred times,"]],[2808,["a saint cannot be a miserly person."]],[2812,["That’s one of the signs of a saint is that he cannot be miserly."]],[2815,["So much thinking of money."]],[2818,["“If you can go this way one pound you can save”."]],[2821,["The money mindedness is so much."]],[2824,["I have seen it every day, you see, people used to work with me."]],[2828,["“We are not buying that paint because if we use"]],[2830,["the whole of the bottle then we cannot return it”."]],[2834,["I mean to that extent what was the need to bother?"]],[2837,["I mean the mind is such."]],[2844,["So don’t save that kind of a thing."]],[2847,["Labour saving devices, money saving devices, you see,"]],[2851,["are very well built in, very clever people."]],[2854,["But they are all against you."]],[2856,["You are so clever that you are cheating yourself."]],[2860,["Don’t cheat yourself. Be careful. You are special people,"]],[2865,["you have to achieve special results with yourself,"]],[2869,["you can do a lot but these are the things you should be careful."]],[2875,["Everyone who keeps the accounts, who sends the money,"]],[2881,["who pays the money, has to be careful also."]],[2885,["And also the people who are taking"]],[2889,["advantage of Sahaja Yoga should be."]],[2891,["There are many books which I have given to people I don’t know"]],[2895,["when did they sell. Except for Gavin I don’t think anybody"]],[2898,["has given me a proper account of the books that were given to him."]],[2901,["Somebody asked me for ten, twenty, I just trusted, I trust people."]],[2908,["Or if they could buy, you see, one Nirmala Yoga."]],[2912,["“Oh we can share Mother about hundred people can have Nirmala Yoga,"]],[2915,["it’s all right”. Yes, that’s very common,"]],[2920,["imagine Nirmala Yoga costs you three pound per year,"]],[2926,["used by hundred people, economical. But that’s the Bible."]],[2936,["Nobody has the sense what we are going to collect."]],[2940,["They’ll collect coins, they’ll collect I don’t know what, stamps,"]],[2945,["I don’t know what else they are collecting here, quite mad people."]],[2950,["But why not collect Nirmala Yoga?"]],[2955,["I mean, I read it, Myself I read my own articles,"]],[2958,["every time I find a new message."]],[2962,["While people have one Nirmala Yoga going round and round and round."]],[2966,["One Nirmala Yoga I saw once, here in the, all torn, tattered this thing"]],[2972,["and I could see all the hands that have been laid on it."]],[2978,["Because If you can save three pounds per year why not do it?"]],[2982,["We’ll have the Nirmala Yoga as well.","Same thing about tapes, Mother’s tapes,"]],[2988,["\"All right, If you have one, can you lend me?”"]],[2991,["By the time it ends up, there is nothing left on the tape."]],[2996,["Is this the way to come to God? To the Generous of generous?"]],[3003,["There is no place for such a people."]],[3006,["God doesn’t like miserly people to enter into His Kingdom."]],[3011,["And when you have money."]],[3013,["I would say that if you are poor people who are starving."]],[3019,["When I started my work in Bombay they all said, “Mother,"]],[3023,["how will You do it alone?” I said ”I’ll manage, don’t you worry.”"]],[3026,["And they said “We want to give you money”. I said “I don’t want."]],[3029,["Just now there is no trust, nothing, let us form a trust”."]],[3033,["When the trust started also"]],[3035,["you must know that I paid lot of money for the trust, Myself."]],[3039,["We started the trust, in trust we started paying."]],[3045,["Then, when we had established properly,"]],[3048,["I said now you can pay."]],[3052,["That year...","[Marathi]"]],[3064,["that moment when I was sitting down, I said now I want money,"]],[3069,["there were not so many Sahaja Yogis, fifteen thousand rupees,"]],[3074,["collected that moment I was sitting there."]],[3077,["“What did you do?” “Mother did everything.” “We didn't do it”."]],[3081,["“Did you sell any ornament?” “Nothing.” “Then how?”"]],[3085,["“We had collected, because you had said that you will be asking"]],[3088,["some time, we have got it.” Cash, they brought."]],[3091,["Fifteen thousand. In one sitting, just like","this I was talking, said fifteen thousand."]],[3097,["and they sorted that paid. Here it is just on the meeting they’ll say,"]],[3101,["“all right, we will pay fifteen thousand tomorrow, day after.”"]],[3104,["A person has to go after you to ask for money like a tax collector."]],[3110,["This is absurd. “Mother I’ve got a very good house, I’ve got"]],[3114,["a very good wife, come and visit my house, I’ll be very happy”."]],[3118,["What have you done for the Big House? You got your own house,"]],[3123,["all the blessings, what have you done for the Big House?"]],[3129,["One must understand that these are symbolic things"]],[3133,["which express your temperament, your nature."]],[3136,["When you are taking drugs you are spending so much money for drugs,"]],[3139,["because you are addicted to it. Why not get addicted to Sahaja Yoga?"]],[3145,["How many of you are addicted to Sahaja Yoga?"]],[3149,["Raise your hands. Raise your hands."]],[3151,["At least promise me from today you are all going to be"]],[3154,["Sahaja Yoga addicted. Come along, raise your hands, all of you."]],[3160,["So this is the good news."]],[3172,["So, New Year has started and it’s a beautiful thing,"]],[3177,["this year has to be something special."]],[3181,["The first thing I was thinking about the","school that you are going to establish"]],[3188,["and which is going to help you and your children very much, to begin with."]],[3194,["And then we’ll be having different ashrams and different places."]],[3199,["Another good news is that we have now got the land"]],[3203,["near the Neera river where you jumped into that river"]],[3207,["and the photograph of that time when you jumped in, is just like this"]],[3211,["in the sky, you find, the light all going","on the sides with rays, it’s wonderful,"]],[3216,["as you see of the Holy Ghost, exactly like that. It’s a photograph."]],[3223,["It was with Dhumal I think, it was an instant photograph."]],[3228,["So that land we have got where you all can have your huts,"]],[3234,["nicely done, for all of you. It’s already arranged."]],[3238,["It’s a beautiful spot, we’re all going to have that nice time, no time."]],[3244,["And our old age is now being completely secured,"]],[3249,["so don’t worry about the old age, don’t try to save for your old age."]],[3261,["Now we are going to India for which we have got two programs"]],[3268,["and please try to make it easier for Me. Don’t make it difficult."]],[3274,["And if you make it easier for Me it’s better for Me,"]],[3276,["because even if I have to worry about everything then it’s difficult."]],[3280,["Like, we are thinking to have you on a plane,"]],[3284,["which will bring you there in time. Now you can imagine,"]],[3287,["you come at a time whenever you feel like at random,"]],[3291,["you want to go back at a time when you want to."]],[3294,["There should be some understanding that taking you to the airport"]],[3298,["from any place takes about thousand rupees sometimes"]],[3302,["and who is going pay for it? Extra?"]],[3305,["But you want to go to the aeroplane, you must tell:"]],[3308,["“Mother, I have to go, I have to catch the plane, what am I to do?”"]],[3311,["Now, that’s not the way. This time all of you are going"]],[3315,["by one plane and coming back by one plane."]],[3318,["We cannot have buses for each and individual persons"]],[3322,["and you know how taxis are expensive in India."]],[3326,["We cannot arrange that. We’ll try to make most of you"]],[3329,["arrive at a time when there will be a bus."]],[3332,["Moreover, if there is an arrangement that is possible,"]],[3335,["we might be able to get a proper concession from Air India"]],[3340,["so that when you come back, mostly now Delhi we are not going,"]],[3343,["so it won’t happen to that extent I am sure."]],[3346,["Like merchants, you see? And carrying luggage,"]],[3352,["every person two hundred kilos,"]],[3357,["will be lessened of course, also Air India will be kind enough"]],[3361,["to help us out with little extra luggage."]],[3365,["But the way people carry their luggage sometimes it’s… I can’t understand."]],[3371,["Two hundred kilos were given once upon a time to me extra"]],[3376,["by Air India because of CP’s position whatever it is"]],[3381,["and that was also used by Sahaja Yogis."]],[3384,["Then all my things were left there"]],[3386,["and they just walked off with my luggage concession"]],[3391,["and those things had to come by ship or by some other people"]],[3394,["for whom I had to pay a lot, doesn’t matter."]],[3397,["Whatever has happened is the past so forget the past."]],[3400,["But is the new life, you should not have all the filth of the old life."]],[3406,["So every year one has to jump out on to a better life,"]],[3413,["a life of magnanimity, of sublimity, of spirituality."]],[3419,["And of spirituality means no sympathy at all for a bhoot."]],[3425,["That’s one thing is definite, no sympathy!"]],[3430,["This should be decided today that"]],[3433,["you will have no sympathy for any bhootish person."]],[3439,["Because when he sits on your head then you start saying"]],[3441,["Mother this has happened, but when you give sympathy to that person"]],[3445,["you don’t understand that you have been doing these things to a person who is anti God."]],[3449,["All bhoots are anti God,","whether they are in you or outside."]],[3454,["So fight them out in you or outside.","Don’t allow any bhoots to be dominating,"]],[3461,["and once you understand this point that they are against God"]],[3466,["and you are the instruments of God,"]],[3469,["you have nothing to do with them, you will get rid of them."]],[3473,["Once you become firm, they just run away."]],[3478,["So this second resolution has to be passed today"]],[3481,["that we’ll have no sympathies with bhootish people"]],[3485,["and will not give funny council by which you stop the work."]],[3489,["Many people are bhootish that way, I know that. Anything you tell them,"]],[3493,["like Channe, I said let us start a school."]],[3496,["“Oh, how can we do it, this is this, this is that”."]],[3498,["I said in Geneva “You start taking that big place.”"]],[3503,["Many people came with great council, I know everything what has happened,"]],[3507,["you may not tell me. I am not there, but I am there."]],[3510,["I know all those people who tried these tricks,"]],[3513,["because they think they are very wise."]],[3515,["At this time I am there to watch you and see you,"]],[3518,["but I witness you. But you will drop out."]],[3523,["This is the point, everything is recorded, whatever you are doing."]],[3526,["God has a registration office and how","many marks you get is very important."]],[3531,["You don’t think that you have been given realization, such a big position;"]],[3537,["then God is not watching you.","He is watching your every step."]],[3541,["There are angels with you to help you and there are Ganas with you,"]],[3545,["but also the registration office is registered."]],[3549,["So be careful. Then later on you will say that"]],[3552,["Mother I’ve missed the bus. There I can’t do any hanky panky,"]],[3556,["I tell you, at that point, I cannot do anything."]],[3559,["Only thing just now whatever is possible I can do it,"]],[3563,["so please work it out in such a way that you really ascend fast"]],[3568,["and this is today you decide."]],[3572,["Tonight. How many are going to get up","tomorrow at four o’clock, raise your hands."]],[3580,["And have their baths before puja?"]],[3584,["And of course everything, not only bath,"]],[3587,["otherwise they’ll say “we had the baths, so it’s all right”. No."]],[3590,["But in proper dresses, you have to be there in time."]],[3595,["Actually so many times I come late because I know"]],[3598,["they must not have yet got up."]],[3601,["What’s the use of reaching there? Then when I reach, they say"]],[3604,["“Mother stop, still is not yet done, we have not arranged.”"]],[3609,["It has happened many a time, so you don’t blame Me for coming late,"]],[3613,["it’s just to give you facilities."]],[3615,["I think that is better to go late so that there’s no problem."]],[3622,["So the good news I have told you already"]],[3625,["that we are going to get beautiful huts for ourselves."]],[3631,["I would like you people to give Me some good designs"]],[3634,["for your huts that you want to buy."]],[3637,["It will be at a very, very nominal cost, but don’t try to save there."]],[3640,["You see, is the saving of savings."]],[3642,["Like this $400 actually I did it"]],[3645,["under a wrong impression. I didn’t know that it was $375 last year."]],[3649,["I thought it was only $300, so I said 100 rupees sufficient to increase."]],[3652,["Now they are all called, shocked, “Mother, what are you doing,"]],[3655,["how can it be? The prices have gone doubled now.”"]],[3657,["I said “Somehow or other I will manage, don’t you worry.” But,"]],[3662,["in the hut business also you must know"]],[3665,["you have to pay for your hut, you cannot get it free there."]],[3669,["Or, “Mother it’s all right, one person will build"]],[3672,["and we’ll come every year, we can share."]],[3677,["It’s all right, you make one hut for us, ten persons can share it”."]],[3683,["This kind of beggaring should not be expressed there."]],[3686,["It’s quite common here, “we’ll share it, it’s all right”."]],[3690,["But where are you going to spend your money that saving all this?"]],[3693,["You won’t shave because you want to save money,"]],[3696,["you won’t go to a hairdresser you want to save money, all right."]],[3699,["Now you don’t want to pay for your food,"]],[3701,["because you want to save money, you don’t want to pay your rent"]],[3703,["because you want to save money, but for what?"]],[3706,["I can understand drunkards doing that because, you see,"]],[3709,["miserly people are around because they are drunkards you know."]],[3711,["Drunkards always have to save money because they have to drink."]],[3714,["But you are no more drunkards now, so why should you save?"]],[3718,["Only drunkards do like that, you see this curse,"]],[3720,["this miserliness is very much in England and all the places,"]],[3724,["this is the reason, because they have to drink, you know, where will they get the money to drink?"]],[3727,["So they save all their money for drinking."]],[3730,["But you are not drunkards any more."]],[3732,["And the thing that you are drinking is the nectar which is free."]],[3736,["So why are you saving all the time your money?"]],[3741,["So money making propositions and money saving proposition,"]],[3745,["if they brought little low,"]],[3748,["you’ll be amazed that these are all joy killing."]],[3751,["Bhoots are joy killing things. A bhootish woman,"]],[3754,["if she is next to Me, you see, I want to run away, can’t bear her."]],[3760,["The reason is she’s so joy killing, she’ll go on saying"]],[3763,["“Mother, what is happening about my marriage now?"]],[3766,["My husband has not written any letter to me.”"]],[3769,["Finished. I’m saying – “Now, fed up of her.”"]],[3771,["Then another will talk “Mother my house is not all right,"]],[3774,["what am I to do? My business is not working out, what am I to do?”"]],[3779,["All very personal petty things they’ll discuss. Not of higher things."]],[3784,["But in America I was so much happier"]],[3788,["that they never asked Me about personal problems, no one."]],[3794,["Always talked about the higher thing. “But how is it, Mother?"]],[3798,["This is the Spirit, when it comes into you,"]],[3801,["how is it the light is not spread so well?”"]],[3804,["They talked about Spirit, Spirit, Spirit, nobody said"]],[3807,["“My husband is like this, my house is sinking,"]],[3810,["what am I to do? I have problems”."]],[3813,["They never talked like that, so they’ll go much faster"]],[3818,["and you will stay stick on with your wives, children"]],[3821,["and your house and maybe I don’t know what else here."]],[3826,["So be careful. Move your attention to higher levels."]],[3832,["Unless and until you move your attention to higher levels,"]],[3835,["how will you jump out?"]],[3843,["And this is another way you can give a lift to the newcomers also."]],[3848,["You see, many newcomers are shocked by the Sahaja Yogis the way they are."]],[3852,["They say “there is no difference."]],[3854,["They tell lies, they try to save money at our cost”."]],[3857,["New people have come, “All right, are you a married man?”"]],[3861,["Then they say “all right! You pay for today.”"]],[3863,["We go to a hotel, he pays for them. The new man is shocked."]],[3868,["All the Sahaja yogis eat there, poor fellow he pays money."]],[3871,["He is without any money, then he thinks \"What sort of Sahaja Yogis these are,"]],[3873,["they are making me pay.” When a","new person comes you all should pay."]],[3878,["But if they know somebody has money then they take out the money."]],[3882,["This is a horrible thing to hear. And the whole problem is of money,"]],[3886,["“my husband doesn’t give me the money, he keeps the money"]],[3889,["at the bank, my wife doesn’t give me money”."]],[3891,["I am fed up of all these talks. Now no more after this,"]],[3895,["at least don’t tell Me. If you want I can give you two sticks,"]],[3899,["you hit your husband or your wife, finish it off. I have nothing to say,"]],[3904,["but don’t tell Me about them."]],[3908,["And if your wife is a bhoot or a husband is a bhoot keep her out."]],[3913,["Don’t take a headache on yourself. And those who are marrying"]],[3917,["because they’re in-love with bhoots better give up."]],[3919,["Otherwise, their love affairs, and this and that,"]],[3922,["all sorts of things, I am so fed up with it."]],[3927,["When are we going to talk about the eternal life?"]],[3934,["All right? So, I think for New Year,"]],[3938,["we have had a little pep talk and a love talk and good news"]],[3943,["maybe we may be allowed to stay here if you all desire,"]],[3946,["if you do not give some wise counseling, I am sure we’ll stay here."]],[3952,["All right, when shifting here also there were lot of wise counseling,"]],[3956,["“It’s very far away, what should we do, this, that” It worked out."]],[3962,["Keep your wisdom to yourself, work it out on yourself."]],[3966,["Try to find out about yourself through your own wisdom,"]],[3969,["“What am I doing?” And you’ll be amazed how it will help you."]],[3973,["You have to shine. You are the leaders of tomorrow."]],[3979,["You have to have your wings on. What are you doing?"]],[3984,["All these heavy loads throw them away, nothing important."]],[3991,["Feel lighter. You have given up all that."]],[3994,["Now we are yogis, we are sanyasis,"]],[3997,["what is going to matter with us, even if you don’t get food, so what?"]],[4001,["God is going to look after us. He looks after us."]],[4009,["And it is happened with people that they have all settled down very well"]],[4014,["those who have faith in their yoga,"]],[4018,["they get their kshema all right. First look after your yoga, is important."]],[4022,["That’s the most important thing to look after your yoga"]],[4026,["by which you do not falter into the ditch of this greed"]],[4033,["and lust and all those things that are surrounding us."]],[4036,["Try to lead a life which is detached."]],[4039,["Detachment one has to develop. Detachment."]],[4044,["Complete detachment is needed."]],[4047,["Today I had a mind of bringing some present for you,"]],[4050,["because, you see, I love it, I love to give you presents."]],[4053,["I don’t know why. That’s an attachment I have."]],[4059,["But I said this today I’ll just have little more detachment about it,"]],[4064,["because if I give it to few then they will be angry."]],[4067,["But I had a mind to give you some presents specially,"]],[4070,["but I’ll give you some special wishes today"]],[4079,["that let your willpower become enlightened;"]],[4085,["let you become the people with great enlightened faith"]],[4096,["and with enlightened strength."]],[4103,["You shed off all these things of the past,"]],[4109,["come out of your shells, come out of your past conditionings"]],[4122,["and without jumping towards your ego,"]],[4126,["cleanse yourself completely, spread your wings"]],[4130,["and like a dignified bird you enjoy the ocean of God’s bliss."]],[4141,["This is what I bless you."]],[4151,["The sky, the sky is the limit. There is no limit to your enjoyment,"]],[4157,["but drop out all these nonsensical things. Just drop out."]],[4160,["You are saints, you are yogis, all of you are."]],[4164,["You are not ordinary mundane people on the street."]],[4167,["Everybody’s feet are to be worshipped, you are of that level."]],[4171,["Your Mother has made you like that after Ganesha."]],[4174,["And what are you doing? Where are you lost?"]],[4180,["Take the responsibility."]],[4183,["May God bless you all!"]]]);
